\section build_cpp_overview Overview

This document provides general instructions for building a %QuantLibAddin C++
environment.  Two builds are supported:

\li the hand-maintained <b>Visual Studio</b> solution file, which runs on Windows;
and
\li the <b>cmake</b> build, which runs on Windows and on POSIX systems such as
Linux.  On Windows the cmake build is x64 only.

The source code is distributed as a single archive that bundles %QuantLibAddin
together with gensrc and ObjectHandler.  The core %QuantLib library is released
separately and must be downloaded alongside them.

